###############################################################################
# FIAP Frames — exemplos para a extensão REST Client do VS Code
# (humao.rest-client). Alternativa ao Postman/Bruno, versionada no repositório.
#
# Como usar:
#   1. make up                     (stack local em http://127.0.0.1:8080)
#   2. abra este arquivo no VS Code e clique em "Send Request" acima de cada bloco,
#      NA ORDEM: o cadastro gera o e-mail, o login guarda o token e o upload guarda o id
#      (variáveis de requisição, sem ids fixos).
# Explicação de cada resposta: docs/exemplos.md.
###############################################################################

@api = http://127.0.0.1:8080
@password = senha-segura-123

### Saúde (processo vivo)
GET {{api}}/api/health/live

### Prontidão (Postgres + buckets)
GET {{api}}/api/health/ready

### Cadastro SEM aceite da política → 400 X0001
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "sem-aceite.{{$timestamp}}@example.com",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Cadastro com aceite → 201 (o e-mail gerado aqui é reaproveitado abaixo)
# @name register
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria.{{$timestamp}}.{{$randomInt 1000 9999}}@example.com",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "acceptPrivacyPolicy": true
}

### Mesmo e-mail de novo → 409 A0002
POST {{api}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "{{register.response.body.$.email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}",
  "acceptPrivacyPolicy": true
}

### Login com senha errada → 401 A0001
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{register.response.body.$.email}}",
  "password": "senha-errada"
}

### Login → 200 { accessToken, tokenType, expiresIn }
# @name login
POST {{api}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{register.response.body.$.email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Perfil → 200
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Perfil sem token → 401 A0003
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me

### Upload do vídeo de 10 s → 202 QUEUED (Idempotency-Key e correlation id opcionais)
# @name upload
POST {{api}}/api/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: exemplo-{{$guid}}
x-correlation-id: exemplo-http-{{$timestamp}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FiapFramesBoundary

------FiapFramesBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="sample-ok-10s.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ../examples/sample-ok-10s.mp4
------FiapFramesBoundary--

@videoId = {{upload.response.body.$.id}}

### Upload do vídeo corrompido → 202 (depois FAILED P0001 + e-mail no Mailpit)
# @name uploadCorrupt
POST {{api}}/api/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FiapFramesBoundary

------FiapFramesBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="sample-corrupt.mp4"
Content-Type: video/mp4

< ../examples/sample-corrupt.mp4
------FiapFramesBoundary--

### Upload de um arquivo que não é vídeo → 400 V0002
POST {{api}}/api/videos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FiapFramesBoundary

------FiapFramesBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="video"; filename="anotacoes.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

isto não é um vídeo
------FiapFramesBoundary--

### Listagem (só os meus vídeos) → 200 { items, total, page, limit }
GET {{api}}/api/videos?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listagem filtrada por status
GET {{api}}/api/videos?status=FAILED
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe com histórico (repita até COMPLETED)
GET {{api}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detalhe do vídeo corrompido (FAILED, errorCode P0001)
GET {{api}}/api/videos/{{uploadCorrupt.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Vídeo inexistente (ou de outro usuário) → 404 V0001
GET {{api}}/api/videos/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Link de download assinado (5 min) → 200 { url, expiresAt }
# @name downloadUrl
POST {{api}}/api/videos/{{videoId}}/download-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Link de download de vídeo FAILED → 409 V0004
POST {{api}}/api/videos/{{uploadCorrupt.response.body.$.id}}/download-url
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Download do zip (o link não precisa de token) → 200 application/zip
GET {{downloadUrl.response.body.$.url}}

### Exportar meus dados (LGPD, art. 18 II e V) → 200
GET {{api}}/api/me/data
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Excluir a conta com a senha errada → 400 A0004
DELETE {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "senha-errada" }

### Excluir a conta (LGPD, art. 18 VI) → 204 — rode por último!
DELETE {{api}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "{{password}}" }

### Token de conta excluída → 401 A0003
GET {{api}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Mailpit: e-mails recebidos por este usuário
GET http://127.0.0.1:8025/api/v1/search?query=to:"{{register.response.body.$.email}}"
